{"id":"e21d9ae53890ee4c","group":"29","path":"29/29-ex-finite-noncompactness.md","title":"有限可满足性的非紧致反例","display":"ex-finite-noncompactness — 有限可满足性的非紧致反例","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-ex-finite-noncompactness","aliases":["29-ex-finite-noncompactness"],"display":"ex-finite-noncompactness — 有限可满足性的非紧致反例","depends_on":["[[29-df-satisfiable]]","[[29-df-sentence]]"],"source_locator":"p.22, DjVu scan 37; 本地构造与完整证明","source_basis":"原书说明有限模型紧致性失效；以下具体反例及证明为本地补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-ex-finite-noncompactness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-ex-finite-noncompactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-finite-noncompactness — 有限可满足性的非紧致反例"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5ea5b4fccf12f679\" href=\"?note=5ea5b4fccf12f679\" title=\"29-df-satisfiable\">29-df-satisfiable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"p.22, DjVu scan 37; 本地构造与完整证明"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书说明有限模型紧致性失效；以下具体反例及证明为本地补充"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\varnothing\">\\(S=\\varnothing\\)</span>，公式仍允许逻辑等号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_m\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_m\\)</span> 为不同变量名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S,\\mathrm{FinSat}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S,\\mathrm{FinSat}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5ea5b4fccf12f679\" href=\"?note=5ea5b4fccf12f679\" title=\"29-df-satisfiable\">29-df-satisfiable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_m\\coloneqq\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_m\\;\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}x_i\\ne x_j,\\qquad\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{\\theta_m\\mid m\\geq1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_m\\coloneqq\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_m\\;\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i&lt;j\\leq m}x_i\\ne x_j,\\qquad\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{\\theta_m\\mid m\\geq1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma\\quad(\\operatorname{card}(\\Delta)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Delta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma\\quad(\\operatorname{card}(\\Delta)&lt;\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Delta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 p.22 指出把紧致性限制到有限结构会失败；这里给出完整反例。对有限子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\max(\\{m:\\theta_m\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{1\\})\">\\(n=\\max(\\{m:\\theta_m\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{1\\})\\)</span>，含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个元素的纯等号结构满足全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\">\\(\\Delta\\)</span>。任意含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个元素的结构不能满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{n+1}\">\\(\\theta_{n+1}\\)</span>，所以没有有限模型满足全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>；自然数集的纯等号结构则是一个无限模型。空子集与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=1\">\\(m=1\\)</span> 的空合取均包含在定义中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfiable]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfiable","status":"resolved","id":"5ea5b4fccf12f679","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_1,\\ldots,x_m$ 为不同变量名；$\\mathrm{Sat}_S,\\mathrm{FinSat}_S$ 见 [[29-df-satisfiable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S,\\mathrm{FinSat}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_m\\coloneqq\\exists x_1\\cdots\\exists x_m\\;\\bigwedge_{1\\leq i<j\\leq m}x_i\\ne x_j,\\qquad\\Gamma\\coloneqq\\{\\theta_m\\mid m\\geq1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\Delta\\subseteq\\Gamma\\quad(\\operatorname{card}(\\Delta)<\\aleph_0\\to\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Delta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{FinSat}_S(\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Sat}_S(\\Gamma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\max(\\{m:\\theta_m\\in\\Delta\\}\\cup\\{1\\})","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"m=1","display":false}],"bytes":1522,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-ex-finite-noncompactness]]"}],"outgoing":["5ea5b4fccf12f679","711217f22972ffc0"]}